      "title": "G'(z) = ∑_{k=1}^∞ k·P(X=k)·z^{k−1} → G'(1) = E[X]",
      "content": "{\"id\":\"TA-1\",\"title\":\"G'(z) = ∑_{k=1}^∞ k·P(X=k)·z^{k−1} → G'(1) = E[X]\",\"primitives\":[],\"addresses\":[]}",
