      "title": "G''(z) = ∑_{k=2}^∞ k(k−1)·P(X=k)·z^{k−2} → G''(1) = E[X(X−1)] = E[X²] − E[X]",
      "content": "{\"id\":\"TA-2\",\"title\":\"G''(z) = ∑_{k=2}^∞ k(k−1)·P(X=k)·z^{k−2} → G''(1) = E[X(X−1)] = E[X²] − E[X]\",\"primitives\":[],\"addresses\":[]}",
